The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for '''Scarecrow''' is {{Green|2,875}}, resulting in a catch chance of {{Chance|28.75%|1|3.48|sea creatures}} in [[Sea Creatures#Spooky|Spooky Sea Creatures]] pool with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Currently there are no modifiers that can be used to increase it.

